cookie: canary=v2", "originalText": "cookie: canary=v2", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 73313621, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 863449653, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "id511443814", "x": 60, "y": 722, "width": 890, "height": 90, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 704400104, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 306030820, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "id341659092", "x": 80, "y": 734, "width": 850, "height": 70, "text": "Sees the full request: path, headers, cookies \u2014 costs CPU for TLS termination + parsing.\nEnables path-based routing, canary releases, and per-request retries an L4 LB can't do.", "originalText": "Sees the full request: path, headers, cookies \u2014 costs CPU for TLS termination + parsing.\nEnables path-based routing, canary releases, and per-request retries an L4 LB can't do.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 106791776, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 265257366, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "id680194284", "x": 1000, "y": 118, "width": 620, "height": 330, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 198427627, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 847393654, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "id444813338", "x": 1024, "y": 138, "width": 570, "height": 24, "text": "ALGORITHMS \u2014 the failure mode each answers", "originalText": "ALGORITHMS \u2014 the failure mode each answers", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#93c5fd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 425939477, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 698282227, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "id217464537", "x": 1024, "y": 176, "width": 570, "height": 260, "text": "Round-robin\n  fails when request cost varies a lot\n\nLeast-connections\n  tracks live conn count \u2014 handles variable cost\n\nWeighted round-robin\n  for heterogeneous instance sizes\n\nConsistent hashing\n  a server joining/leaving only moves ITS slice\n  (naive mod-N reshuffles almost every key)", "originalText": "Round-robin\n  fails when request cost varies a lot\n\nLeast-connections\n  tracks live conn count \u2014 handles variable cost\n\nWeighted round-robin\n  for heterogeneous instance sizes\n\nConsistent hashing\n  a server joining/leaving only moves ITS slice\n  (naive mod-N reshuffles almost every key)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 525582549, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 675491558, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "id482937895", "x": 1000, "y": 472, "width": 620, "height": 220, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 520723704, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 862676467, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "id660921255", "x": 1024, "y": 492, "width": 570, "height": 24, "text": "HEALTH CHECKS", "originalText": "HEALTH CHECKS", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#93c5fd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 894334567, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 166511944, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "id655516743", "x": 1024, "y": 530, "width": 570, "height": 150, "text": "Active (LB pings /health)\n  catches fully-down; misses slow-but-technically-up\n\nPassive (LB watches live error rate / latency)\n  catches the slow-but-up case active checks miss", "originalText": "Active (LB pings /health)\n  catches fully-down; misses slow-but-technically-up\n\nPassive (LB watches live error rate / latency)\n  catches the slow-but-up case active checks miss", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 419122749, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 800628091, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}